Serve proxy-owned UI resources and portable host-bridge components for status, view edits and change preview/apply. Reuse browser components where practical, use authorized app-visible tools, bind interactions to user/revision, and keep secrets outside model-visible payloads. Provide browser navigation for sensitive credential entry and unsupported capabilities. Acceptance: embedded flow and text/browser fallback reach same service and permissions. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
